      "title": "Generate Video \u2014 Ref2VA with three guides",
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VLLMOmniGenerateVideo"},
      "widgets_values": ["http://localhost:8000/v1", "MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3", "A three-shot cinematic sequence built from four anchors.\nShot 1 (frames 0-35): <Picture 1> defines the subject's identity, wardrobe, and color palette; the video opens on that composition and holds it with a slow push-in.\nShot 2 (frames 36-71): at 1.5 s the video cuts to the first keyframe, the same subject turned three-quarters toward the light, keeping identity, wardrobe, and grade.\nShot 3 (frames 72-119): at 3.0 s it cuts to the second keyframe, a tighter angle of the same subject mid-motion, with the camera easing to a stop.\nEnding (frames 120-123): at 5.0 s it settles into the third keyframe and holds there to the last frame.\nCoherent motion between anchors, consistent lighting and characters across the cuts, no flicker or morphing. Audio: continuous ambient room tone with a quiet sustained score that follows the cuts.", "", 1344, 768, 24, 5.167]
    },
