    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [800, 760],
      "size": [470, 380],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 12,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How the four anchors map",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["## Four anchors, three shots\nThis template recreates the official ComfyUI MiniMax H3 Multiframe Reference layout on a remote vLLM-Omni server.\n\n- **Frame 1** is the semantic reference, prompt tag `<Picture 1>`, and the opening composition of shot 1.\n- **Frames 2-4** are timeline guides at 1.5 s, 3.0 s, and 5.0 s: the video must pass through those compositions at frames 36, 72, and 120.\n\nSelect your own four images; the loader filenames are placeholders. Guide images pin a composition but are not `<Picture N>` references, so the prompt only tags `<Picture 1>`. Rewrite the prompt for your own assets and keep the timing words (1.5 s / 3.0 s / 5.0 s) aligned with the guide indices.\n\n**Output:** 24 FPS, 1344x768, 124 frames (17k+5, about 5.17 s), base H3 at 50 sampling points with video/audio flow shifts 12/3. The server aligns guide indices to 17k+5 clips and rejects an index that does not fit."]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [1360, 560],
      "size": [410, 380],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 13,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Server requirements",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["## Server requirements\nGuided requests need base MiniMax-H3 weights: keep **FastH3 Deployment**, **Remote LoRA** (including Turbo), and **Latent Mask Editing** disconnected. Generate Video sends `fps=24` and `quality=lossless` for guided requests, and the server rejects cache acceleration, distilled schedules, and `audio_mode=lock_source`.\n\nUse a vLLM-Omni server that includes timeline-guide support and set the served model name to the MiniMax-H3 spec (for example `MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3`). The graph sends a Ref2VA request: references first, then the three guides, so the prompt still sees `<Picture 1>` as the identity reference.\n\nValidate the graph locally with:\n`python -m pytest tests/e2e/features/comfyui/test_h3_multiframe_reference_workflow.py -q`\n\nReal-model generation, saved audio, and guide placement still need a server run."]
    }
  ],
